grow; gather compost on Patches and use it when planting to improve your odds\n- New botany seeds and mutations, including Moonblossom at Botany 70\n- Botany menu: Crops, Herbs, Flowers, Trees\n- Pruners give reduced Botany XP\n\nFeatures\n- New in-game mailbox! Open mail from the top bar, read messages, and claim attached items\n- Bazaar expanded to six offer slots; recent trades open from a button on the page\n- XP and Loot trackers under your location name on the map\n- Lockpicks require Thievery 20\n- Added soup stock, go to a kitchen and combine water and kitchen scraps, used to make stews and soups\n- Signing in on another device ends your other active session while you are playing\n\nMinor balance changes\nMinor UI tweaks\nMinor art updates\n\nVari - ❤️","catalogId":"mail-update-2026-09-22","claimedAt":null,"id":"mail-update-2026-09-22","readAt":null,"sentAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","subject":"Update (Sep 22–23)"},{"attachments":[],"body":"Update (Sep 23–24)\n\nCombat\n- Enemies now use Might and Vitality; bestiary shows Combat XP plus those stats\n- Rebalanced XP for defeating monsters\n- Danger warnings updated for Goblin Camp, Docks, Queen's Quarters, and Castle Crypt\n- Auto-eat after each combat round; Eat now on the map on the right (inventory Eat menu unchanged)\n- Twelve new foes listed in the bestiary (not placed in the world yet)\n\nMountains\n- Mountains are a sub-map with The Slopes, Temple, The Peak, Badlands, and Giant Camp\n- The Peak and Giant Camp are hostile areas with new fights\n\nGathering\n- Expanded gathering and recipes through higher levels: wild boar hunt, new trees and mines, marlin and swordfish, and more\n- Added willow, cinnamon, ironwood, Elder Yew, and Heartwood woodcutting\n- Added chromium and vanadium ore and bars\n- Rebalanced Starroot; added Bleeding Tooth mushrooms\n- Man of War at the jellyfish tier\n- New gathering actions are in menus and the codex but not placed at a location yet (wild boar hunt in Kingswoods is live)\n\nLeather\n- Cows, bulls, and elk drop hides instead of leather\n- Tanner at each Crafting Workshop: tan hides from your bag or bank for gold\n\nMinor UI tweaks\n\nVari - ❤️","catalogId":"mail-update-2026-09-24","claimedAt":null,"id":"mail-update-2026-09-24","readAt":null,"sentAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","subject":"Update (Sep 23–24)"}],"maxHp":1000,"miniquestCompletedAt":{},"motto":null,"playTimeMs":0,"productionQuantityRemaining":null,"productionQuantityTotal":null,"productionRecipeId":null,"quests":[],"raceId":null,"rankedPvpDayKey":null,"rankedPvpFightsToday":0,"rankedPvpLosses":0,"rankedPvpWins":0,"saveVersion":54,"settings":{"autoEat":true,"eatHealthThresholdAsPercent":false,"eatHealthThresholdPercent":100,"hudShowTotalXp":false,"potionsPaused":false,"showActivityRewards":true,"showEatButton":true,"skipHostileTravelWarning":false,"soundEnabled":true},"shopPurchaseDayKey":null,"shopPurchasesToday":{},"skills":[{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0001","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0016","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0002","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0003","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0004","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0005","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0006","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0007","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0008","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0009","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0010","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0011","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0012","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0013","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0014","xp":0},{"level":1,"skillId":"SKL-0015","xp":0}],"statistics":{"values":{}},"unattendedProgressAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","unlockedLocationIds":[],"unlockedNpcIds":[],"unlockedRecipeIds":[],"updatedAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","xpTrackerPausedAtMs":1767225600000,"xpTrackers":{}},"source":"content"},"module":"multiplayer/snapshot","output":{"boardKeys":["total_level","combat_level","guild_total_level","total_level_combat_1","gold_earned","gold","monsters_killed"